  "totalBlocks": 15,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55310864e393cb04",
      "translationZh": "我针对嵌入式工程用例做了一些基准测试，Gemini 已经完全赶上了 sonnet，甚至表现得比它更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f6e31b729acaaa8",
      "translationZh": "这些都是真实案例，甚至会实际测试收到的 C 代码的编译情况和输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e63d4c534656183",
      "translationZh": "大多数案例涉及嵌入式 Linux 和 zephyr。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e63ba640e06fe362",
      "translationZh": "我很欣赏 muse glimmer 相对于其规模而言确实表现得很好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d240ee8d401e098",
      "translationZh": "Ecro Benchmark 的 EmbedEval — 方法论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a73118c921f1aec6",
      "translationZh": "数据集：219 项嵌入式固件任务，涵盖 Zephyr RTOS（158）、嵌入式 Linux（51）、ESP-IDF（5）、STM32 HAL（4）、FreeRTOS（1），覆盖 24 个类别（DMA、ISR/并发、线程、网络、安全、BLE、启动、设备树、Yocto 等）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dc70eb14632276a",
      "translationZh": "评估层级（首次失败即停止该案例的评估）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7845164ee779be4f",
      "translationZh": "- L0 静态 — 对原始代码进行结构/模式检查，每个案例都执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dab84fb3ffe1129",
      "translationZh": "- L1 编译 — 真实构建；实际只对 Zephyr 执行了这一层（在真实的工具链容器内执行 west build）。Embedded Linux 用例按设计不进行编译（属于配置/文本格式任务）；本轮测试未配置 ESP-IDF、STM32 HAL 和 FreeRTOS 的工具链，因此这些用例自动通过这一层，而非真正接受了测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe8a09e9a192b96b",
      "translationZh": "- L2 运行时 — 二进制程序实际运行（native_sim）；范围与 L1 相同，仅限 Zephyr",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d7924e5037d752f",
      "translationZh": "- L3 行为 — 编译器无法捕捉的领域规则（例如 ISR 共享变量上的 volatile、锁顺序）；对每个用例都执行了这一层",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3446f262c6dc714",
      "translationZh": "所以：Zephyr 的结果反映了完整的 4 层流水线。Embedded Linux、ESP-IDF、STM32 HAL 和 FreeRTOS 的结果仅反映 L0 + L3 — 有实际参考价值，但未经编译器/运行时验证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86950151f8d36774",
      "translationZh": "测试条件：单次作答，没有智能体/工具辅助框架 — 一个提示，一次回复，直接评分。没有重试或自我纠正。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ca89a2c467d308c",
      "translationZh": "所有模型均使用默认投入程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3872b240e6b5a6fe",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Ok-Inevitable8391 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
